{"availability":"available","full":"CintraAI/code-chunker","name":"code-chunker","description":"A tool for intelligently chunking and parsing code files, enhancing readability and maintainability by organizing code around key points of interest.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":88,"forks":13,"created":"2024-02-27T00:46:08Z","updated":"2025-06-11T19:42:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/CintraAI/code-chunker","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:10.133Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:10.133Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:10.133Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T04:52:10.133Z","stars":88,"forks":13}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Cintra's Code Chunker is a novel open-source tool designed to enhance code readability and maintainability by intelligently chunking code files based on key points of interest. This tool leverages advanced parsing techniques to identify significant elements in your code, such as functions, classes, and comments, to organize your codebase into manageable, easily understandable chunks. It's an invaluable resource for applications such as RAG, code patching, and other use cases."],"features":["Intelligent Chunking: Break down your code files into chunks around key points of interest like function definitions, class declarations, and crucial comments.","Customizable Token Limits: Control the size of each chunk with customizable token limits, ensuring that chunks remain manageable and focused.","Support for Multiple Languages: Initially supporting Python, JavaScript, and CSS, with plans to expand to more programming languages."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CintraAI/code-chunker/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9ae29302903504a437403410f9c2df1ea6c3dff7489959f9d8d8701a9d59d1ce","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:10.234Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:10.234Z",